NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001180 "the same terms as the Perl 5 programming language system itself."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001181 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001182 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001183 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001184 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Progress-Any>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001185 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001186 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001187 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001188 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001189 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001190 "=cut"
BODY_END
